<title>SWITZERLAND: Novartis to report Q1 sales on April 17.</title>
<headline>Novartis to report Q1 sales on April 17.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novartis AG said it would report first-quarter 1997 group sales figures on April 17 before the Swiss Stock Exchange opens at 0730 GMT.</p>
<p>It did not give a precise time for the announcement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
